cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MUSA, please cite the exact version you used, as below."
type: software
title: "MUSA: Multifractal Spectrum Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  QGIS plugin and Python library for fractal and multifractal analysis of
  fault, fracture and lineament maps. It computes Renyi dimensions and
  Chhabra-Jensen spectra from the exact trace length in each grid cell,
  checks whether a finite-range scaling estimate is supported before reporting
  it, and offers a Monte Carlo test that relocates the observed traces within
  the mapped area.
